<view class="page">
  <view class="title">check@collect</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!needRegister}}">请确认这是你在电脑上发起的登录或绑定请求。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!needRegister}}">如果不是你本人操作，请直接关闭。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!ticket && !needRegister}}" class="pairing">
    <view>网页上的十二位配对码：</view>
    <input type="text" maxlength="12" value="{{pairing}}" bindinput="onPairingInput" placeholder="例如 A1B2C3D4E5F6" />
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{!needRegister}}" type="primary" bindtap="confirm" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || done}}">确认微信身份</button>

  <view wx:if="{{needRegister}}" class="pairing">
    <view>该微信还没有绑定账号。注册一个采集者账号即可继续，其他角色由管理员分配。</view>
    <view class="field-label">账号名</view>
    <input type="text" maxlength="64" value="{{username}}" bindinput="onUsernameInput" placeholder="3-64 位字母、数字或 . _ -" />
    <view class="field-label">显示姓名</view>
    <input type="text" maxlength="100" value="{{displayName}}" bindinput="onNameInput" placeholder="留空则使用账号名" />
    <view class="field-label">密码</view>
    <input type="password" maxlength="128" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPasswordInput" placeholder="至少 10 位" />
    <button type="primary" bindtap="register" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || done}}">注册采集者账号并绑定微信</button>
  </view>
  <view>{{message}}</view>
</view>
